<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" id="htmlRoot">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Approval Pending | RKU Attendance</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0/css/all.min.css">
    <style>
        :root {
            --primary: #2c3e50; --accent: #3498db; --warning: #f39c12;
            --bg: #f0f2f5; --card: #ffffff; --text: #2c3e50; --muted: #7f8c8d;
            --border: #eee; --note-bg: #fff9f0;
        }
        html.dark {
            --bg: #1a1e2a; --card: #242938; --text: #d4daf0; --muted: #7a87a3;
            --border: #303550; --note-bg: #2a2010;
        }
        * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            background: var(--bg); color: var(--text);
            min-height: 100vh; display: flex; align-items: center;
            justify-content: center; padding: 20px;
            transition: background 0.3s, color 0.3s;
        }
        .container {
            background: var(--card);
            padding: 44px 36px;
            max-width: 460px; width: 100%;
            border-radius: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 16px 48px rgba(0,0,0,0.12);
            text-align: center;
            border-top: 5px solid var(--warning);
            animation: fadeIn 0.4s ease;
        }
        @keyframes fadeIn {
            from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px); }
            to   { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
        }
        .icon-box {
            font-size: 64px; color: var(--warning); margin-bottom: 22px;
            animation: pulse 2.4s ease-in-out infinite;
        }
        @keyframes pulse {
            0%, 100% { transform: scale(1); opacity: 1; }
            50% { transform: scale(1.08); opacity: 0.75; }
        }
        h2 { color: var(--text); margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 1.4rem; }
        .subtitle { color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.7; font-size: 15px; margin-bottom: 18px; }
        .user-badge {
            background: var(--bg); padding: 9px 18px; border-radius: 30px;
            display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin: 4px 0 18px;
            border: 1.5px solid var(--border); color: var(--text); font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 14px; max-width: 100%; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis;
        }
        .status-info {
            background: var(--note-bg); border-left: 4px solid var(--warning);
            padding: 16px 18px; margin: 0 0 22px; text-align: left;
            font-size: 14px; border-radius: 8px; color: var(--text);
        }
        .status-info strong { display: block; margin-bottom: 8px; color: var(--warning); }
        .status-info ul { margin: 0; padding-left: 18px; }
        .status-info li { margin-bottom: 5px; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.5; }
        .step-badge {
            display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            width: 22px; height: 22px; background: var(--warning); color: white;
            border-radius: 50%; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 800; margin-right: 6px;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }
        .status-info li { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 4px; list-style: none; margin-bottom: 8px; }
        .btn-logout {
            display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px;
            background: var(--primary); color: white;
            padding: 13px 32px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 10px;
            font-weight: 700; transition: 0.25s; font-size: 15px;
        }
        .btn-logout:hover { filter: brightness(1.15); transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.2); }
        html.dark .btn-logout { background: #4a7fb5; }
        .footer-note { font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 18px; opacity: 0.7; }

        @media (max-width: 480px) {
            .container { padding: 32px 20px; }
            h2 { font-size: 1.2rem; }
            .icon-box { font-size: 52px; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container">
    <div class="icon-box"><i class="fas fa-user-clock"></i></div>
    <h2>Approval Pending</h2>
    <p class="subtitle">Your registration is received! A system administrator must verify your identity before access is granted.</p>

    <div class="user-badge">
        <i class="fas fa-envelope" style="color:var(--warning);flex-shrink:0;"></i>
        <span style="overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap;"><%= user.email %></span>
    </div>

    <div class="status-info">
        <strong><i class="fas fa-list-check"></i> &nbsp;What Happens Next</strong>
        <ul>
            <li><span class="step-badge">1</span> Notify your Department Head or HOD.</li>
            <li><span class="step-badge">2</span> Admin reviews and approves your account.</li>
            <li><span class="step-badge">3</span> Verification usually takes 2–4 hours.</li>
            <li><span class="step-badge">4</span> You will gain full dashboard access once approved.</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <a href="/logout" class="btn-logout"><i class="fas fa-sign-out-alt"></i> Return to Login</a>

    <p class="footer-note"><i class="fas fa-headset"></i> Urgent? Contact the IT Helpdesk for assistance.</p>
</div>
<script>
    if (localStorage.getItem('rku-theme') === 'dark') {
        document.getElementById('htmlRoot').classList.add('dark');
    }
</script>
</body>
</html>
